error[SCXML055]: `<raise>` inside `<finalize>` raises an event, which `<finalize>` must not do
 --> tests/ui/scxml055-raise-in-finalize.scxml:8:77
  |
8 |     <invoke type="http://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/" src="child.scxml"><finalize><raise event="x"/></finalize></invoke>
  |                                                                   --------  ^^^^^ `<raise>` is not allowed here
  |                                                                   |
  |                                                                   inside this `<finalize>` of an `<invoke>`
  |
  = note: `<finalize>` runs while an event returned by the invoked service is being processed, before transitions are selected, to update the data model from `_event`; SCXML forbids it to raise events or invoke external actions, naming `<send>` and `<raise>` explicitly
  = help: keep only data-model updates (`<assign>`, `<log>`, `<if>`, `<foreach>`) in `<finalize>`; to react to the returned event, move the `<raise>` into a `<transition>` that matches it
  = spec: SCXML 1.0 §6.5 <finalize>
help: remove the `<raise>` element
  |
